   329	   `y^2=x^2(x+1)`, has normalization `A1` and a self-node, hence Euler number
   330	   zero.  Its embedded boundary resolution contains a cycle.  Thus the
   331	   morphic forest input is genuinely load-bearing.
   332	3. The degree-four partition `(2,2)` shows why a generic finite image of a
